      "problem": "Find the real part of the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} & 7-6\\text{i} \\\\ -\\text{i} & 4\\end{aligned}].$",
      "worked_solution": "For the given matrix $A,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} & 7-6\\text{i} \\\\ -\\text{i} & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1+2\\text{i} & 7-6\\text{i} \\\\ 0-\\text{i} & 4+0\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Re}(A)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}2 & -6 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{\\text{Im}(A)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{Re}(A)=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}].$",
